						now: '`a` is `--color-text`; hover and `.active` are `--token-semantics-primary-base`, which does *not* follow `--color-primary`; the active underline is `border-block-end: 2px solid transparent` — the space is reserved but nothing is drawn; and `.desktop .header-navigation .app-menu-links > a:hover` gained `background-color: --token-bg-neutral-subtlest-hover`',
