					text: '`--token-semantics-primary-base` and `--token-text-primary` are separate tokens with separate defaults (`#105cef` and `#0f54da`). Re-pointing the first at `--color-primary` fixes links, the active nav item, the dropdown checkmark and the range slider\'s connect — which is most of what gets reported — so it is easy to call the problem solved. `--token-text-primary` is read a further 14 times and stays blue, most visibly as the Upload pattern\'s "select file" label.',
