					text: 'Those reads include **checkbox, radio, switch, wizard step icon, datepicker and the dropdown popup**, not just `.form-control[data-input]`. A rule of yours like `background: var(--color-neutral-2); border: none;` is a normal thing to want on a text field and a disaster as a role: promoted, it strips the ring off every checkbox and radio in the app, and you report "checkboxes disappeared" with nothing in their own CSS to explain it.',
